    "title": "Exact EMPTY, singleton, and Johnson prefilter for large-source FPC5 cells",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For a fixed large-source FPC5 full-petal cell with h=t ell, r=2d-h, and u=d-(t-1)ell, u>b makes the cell empty; r<0 or 2d>N+(t-2)ell+b makes it a singleton; and the ordinary and joint-background positive-Johnson denominators give polynomial fixed-cell payments. Every unpaid cell therefore lies in the exact residual (PF6).",
